{"id":"chto","lemma":"что","pos":"pron","rank":3,"glosses":["what","that, which"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0c/Ru-%D1%87%D1%82%D0%BE2.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%82%D0%BE2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Что ты делаешь?","en":"What do you make?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1693","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]},{"text":"Что бы я без тебя делал?","en":"What would I do without you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/33654","words":[null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]},{"text":"Что бы вы сделали иначе?","en":"What would you do differently?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/219220","words":[null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю, что я думаю.","en":"I know what I think.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274760","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"}]},{"text":"Просто скажи мне, что это.","en":"Just tell me what it is.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283268","words":[{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"this / it is"}]}]}